ぬともおもほえず人の心ぞ風も吹きあへぬ", "url": "https://wakastream.jp/article/10000315SDFG"}, {"title": "万葉集巻第10", "url": "http://www.c-able.ne.jp/~y_mura/manyou/man010.html"}, {"title": "源俊頼朝臣 百人一首の意味と解説「うかりける 人を初瀬の 山おろし はげしかれとは 祈らぬものを」", "url": "https://programming-cafe.com/culture/literature/claja/100nin1-74/"}, {"title": "百人一首 一覧", "url": "https://polygondrill.com/firstkaruta/list"}, {"title": "徒然草 (校註日本文學大系) - Wikisource", "url": "https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%BE%92%E7%84%B6%E8%8D%89_(%E6%A0%A1%E8%A8%BB%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E6%96%87%E5%AD%B8%E5%A4%A7%E7%B3%BB)"}, {"title": "心守詩（こころまもるうた）", "url": "https://sakanolab.com/2020/11/24/%E5%BF%83%E5%AE%88%E8%A9%A9%EF%BC%88%E3%81%93%E3%81%93%E3%82%8D%E3%81%BE%E3%82%82%E3%82%8B%E3%81%86%E3%81%9F%EF%BC%89/"}]}, "The search did not find a source for this poem. None of the results contain the verse 神奈備に ひもろぎ立てて斎へども 人の心は守りあへぬもの, so I can't confirm its source (出典) or author (作者) from these results.\n\nThe results were off-topic: a dissertation on Heian waka expression, the Meiji Emperor's poetry collection, a Kokinshu poem about cherry blossoms and changing hearts (さくら花とくちりぬともおもほえず 人の心ぞ風も吹きあへぬ, attributed to 紀貫之 in 古今和歌集), and a Man'yoshu poem with a 神なび reference. The Kokinshu poem shares the \"人の心\" and \"吹きあへぬ\" wording, but it is a different poem.\n\nTo track down the original, I'd suggest searching the full verse in quotation marks on a waka database such as 和歌データベース (Kokka Database) or Wikisource, or searching the 神奈備 and ひもろぎ wording together with 和歌 or 詠み人."], "durationSeconds": 6.722417416999997, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01SjTddJEXJeS5XJvrHgyrJH", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
